  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\nWhat would you like to see in Matrix? If your idea is vaguely complete enough, we\r\nrecommend submitting [an MSC](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/proposals) instead.\r\n\r\nAfter a period configured in the room settings, messages exceeding the defined period should be redacted or made inaccessible. The purpose for this would be to improve privacy",
